    "question": {
      ":question/id": "b0ca77aa-eea0-5b58-8584-cc99fd32b75c",
      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\cos\\left(\\frac{11 \\pi}{12}\\right)}{\\csc\\left(\\frac{11 \\pi}{12}\\right)}\n$$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Rewrite the reciprocal denominator to expose a sine\u2013cosine product.\n\nSet $x=\\frac{11 \\pi}{12}$.\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\cos\\left(x\\right)}{\\csc\\left(x\\right)}=\\cos\\left(x\\right)\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\csc\\left(x\\right)}=\\sin x\\cos x\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\sin x\\cos x &=\\sin(2x) \\\\ &=\\sin\\left(\\frac{11 \\pi}{6}\\right) \\\\ &=- \\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute this exact value:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\cos\\left(\\frac{11 \\pi}{12}\\right)}{\\csc\\left(\\frac{11 \\pi}{12}\\right)}&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right) \\\\ &=- \\frac{1}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
